# Codex permission rules. Tracked deliberately: an untracked allow-list is per-machine, so
# two operators get different agent behaviour from the same task.
# Read-only and hermetic only. Mutating and irreversible commands are deliberately absent --
# they fall through to a prompt, which is the decision point.
# Added 2026-08-31.
# Verified 2026-08-31: no recipe in this repo's justfile mutates a cluster, applies
# Terraform, pushes, or opens a PR. Blanket allow is therefore safe, and stays correct as
# recipes are added rather than going stale. RE-CHECK if a mutating recipe is ever added.
prefix_rule(pattern=["just"], decision="allow")
